    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 2.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Si quis ieiunium suum infringat, servus corio suo componat, liber pauper reddat xxx denarios et tainus regis cxx sol.; et dividatur haec pecunia pauperibus.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In the case of the fast being broken—if it is a slave [who does so], he shall undergo the lash, if it is a poor freeman, he shall pay 30 pence, and a thegn of the king's [shall pay] 120 shillings. And this money shall be divided among the poor.</ab>
      </div>
